title: "munkres"
type: software
abstract: >-
  The Munkres (Hungarian) algorithm for the assignment problem in pure Python,
  with forbidden pairings, rectangular matrices, exact Decimal/Fraction
  arithmetic, optimality certificates and related matching tools.
